<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8" standalone="yes"?><rss version="2.0" xmlns:atom="http://www.w3.org/2005/Atom"><channel><title>io on Go 中文档集</title><link>https://before80.github.io/go_docs/stdLib/io/</link><description>Recent content in io on Go 中文档集</description><generator>Hugo</generator><language>zh-cn</language><lastBuildDate>Wed, 02 Apr 2025 16:27:58 +0800</lastBuildDate><atom:link href="https://before80.github.io/go_docs/stdLib/io/index.xml" rel="self" type="application/rss+xml"/><item><title>fs</title><link>https://before80.github.io/go_docs/stdLib/io/fs/</link><pubDate>Wed, 17 May 2023 11:11:20 +0800</pubDate><guid>https://before80.github.io/go_docs/stdLib/io/fs/</guid><description>&lt;blockquote&gt;
&lt;p&gt;原文：&lt;a href="https://pkg.go.dev/io/fs@go1.24.2"&gt;https://pkg.go.dev/io/fs@go1.24.2&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/blockquote&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Package fs defines basic interfaces to a file system. A file system can be provided by the host operating system but also by other packages.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;​	&lt;code&gt;fs&lt;/code&gt;包定义了与文件系统交互的基本接口。文件系统可以由操作系统提供，也可以由其他包提供。&lt;/p&gt;</description></item><item><title>io</title><link>https://before80.github.io/go_docs/stdLib/io/io/</link><pubDate>Wed, 17 May 2023 11:11:20 +0800</pubDate><guid>https://before80.github.io/go_docs/stdLib/io/io/</guid><description>&lt;blockquote&gt;
&lt;p&gt;原文：&lt;a href="https://pkg.go.dev/io@go1.24.2"&gt;https://pkg.go.dev/io@go1.24.2&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/blockquote&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Package io provides basic interfaces to I/O primitives. Its primary job is to wrap existing implementations of such primitives, such as those in package os, into shared public interfaces that abstract the functionality, plus some other related primitives.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;​	&lt;code&gt;io&lt;/code&gt;包提供了基本的I/O原语接口。它的主要任务是将这些原语的现有实现(例如os包中的实现)封装到共享的公共接口中，以抽象功能，以及一些其他相关的原语。&lt;/p&gt;</description></item><item><title>ioutil</title><link>https://before80.github.io/go_docs/stdLib/io/ioutil/</link><pubDate>Wed, 17 May 2023 11:11:20 +0800</pubDate><guid>https://before80.github.io/go_docs/stdLib/io/ioutil/</guid><description>&lt;blockquote&gt;
&lt;p&gt;原文：&lt;a href="https://pkg.go.dev/io/ioutil@go1.24.2"&gt;https://pkg.go.dev/io/ioutil@go1.24.2&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/blockquote&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Package ioutil implements some I/O utility functions.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Deprecated: As of Go 1.16, the same functionality is now provided by package io or package os, and those implementations should be preferred in new code. See the specific function documentation for details.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2 id="常量"&gt;常量&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This section is empty.&lt;/p&gt;
